<title>USA: South Brunswick, N.J., school bonds won by Goldman.</title>
<headline>South Brunswick, N.J., school bonds won by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it won $41 million Board of Education of the Township of South Brunswick, N.J., bonds at a true interest cost of 5.441 percent.</p>
